  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1502.64 Standard alteration of terrain permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1502.64 “Standard alteration of terrain permit” means authorization to undertake alteration of terrain activities as specified in Env-Wq 1503.02 that is not a general permit by rule, a timber harvesting permit by rule, or a permit by notification.\n\nSource. #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36; renumbered by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.62)",
